# Wake tick

The always-on tick is a keepalive. It is not a new assignment and it is not a queue ranking. The GitHub Actions runner is the repository-side keepalive for this same session.

When this session has unfinished accepted work, the tick's required follow-up is the next unfinished item in that work. A poll with no new events does not end the turn. The poll's `nextExecutable` field is not a new assignment.

Follow `docs/governance/AGENT-EXECUTION.md`. Where a tick message disagrees with that document, that document wins. An unapproved Cursor workaround is denied.
